FTYP SONPROJ 19 ! Sonnet Project File
VER "18.53"
HEADER
LIC sonnetexample.0000
BUILT_BY_SAVED example "18.53"
EXF
END HEADER
DIM
ANG DEG
CAP PF
CON /OH
FREQ GHZ
IND NH
LNG MM
RES OH
END DIM
CONTROL
VARSWP
OPTIONS  -d
SPEED 0
SUBSPLAM N 100
CACHE_ABS 1
Q_ACC N
END CONTROL
GEO
TMET "Lossless" 0 SUP 0 0 0 0
BMET "Lossless" 0 SUP 0 0 0 0
MET "Array" 77 VOL .25 0 RPV
BOX 2 1 1 40 40 100 0
0.1 1 1 0 0 0 0 "Air_top"
0.1 1 1 0 0 0 0 "Air_mid"
0.1 1 1 0 0 0 0 "Air_bottom"
LORGN 0 1 U
POR1 STD
POLY 9 1
3
1 50 0 0 0 0 0.5
POR1 STD
POLY 10 1
1
2 50 0 0 0 1 0.5
NUM 3
0 5 -1 N 9 1 1 100 100 0 0 0 Y
0 0.45
0.45 0.45
0.45 0.55
0 0.55
0 0.45
END
1 5 -1 N 10 1 1 100 100 0 0 0 Y
0.55 0.45
1 0.45
1 0.55
0.55 0.55
0.55 0.45
END
VIA POLYGON
0 5 0 N 11 1 1 100 100 0 0 0 Y
TOLEVEL 1 RING COVERS
0.4 0.4
0.6 0.4
0.6 0.6
0.4 0.6
0.4 0.4
END
END GEO
OPT
MAX 100
END OPT
VARSWP
ENABLED Y
FREQ Y AN LIST 0.001 0.01 0.1 1 10
END
END VARSWP
FILEOUT
TOUCH ND Y native_raw.s2p IC 15 S RI R 50.00000
FOLDER .
END FILEOUT
